    "_instructions": [
        "Nominals are taken directly from v_plane_param_define_ustol_v1() in LAT_SIM_Runner.cpp.",
        "sigma_3 = 3-sigma bound (absolute). The runner samples N(0, sigma_3/3) clipped to +/-sigma_3.",
        "EVERY key here MUST have a matching else-if in apply_override() in LAT_SIM_MonteCarlo.cpp,",
        "otherwise the perturbation is silently ignored.",
        "Field-mapping notes:",
        "  cg_x_cg_c   -> vehcle.cg.x_cg_c   (NON-dimensional aero CG; NOT vehcle.cg_x)",
        "  max_thrust  -> s_motor[i].max_thrust for all motors; the map MUST recompute CT_static after.",
        "  s,b         -> after setting, the map SHOULD recompute vehcle.AR = b*b/s.",
        "Zero-nominal fields (Ixz, cg.z_cg, lateral/yaw kr/kaf/kcu/kalpha) are omitted:",
        "  a percentage sigma of 0 cannot perturb them. Add absolute sigmas later if desired.",
        "Mission: full auto_flight2-style 7-phase profile (consumed once the runner is extended)."
